OL,3,GNEWSAOrange Order submits new 'limited'
OL,4,ADrumcree parade plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Orange Order has announced plans
OL,7,Ffor a new parade at Drumcree, one of
OL,8,Fthe most contentious parade routes in
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,11,FIt said the plans had been scaled back
OL,12,Fand it hoped the parade would be
OL,13,Fallowed along the mainly nationalist
OL,14,FGarvaghy Road. Instead of 400 people
OL,15,Fand two bands taking part, only 60
OL,16,Fmembers would march along the road in
OL,17,FPortadown in silence on Sunday 27
OL,18,FSeptember.
OL,20,FThe submission comes after a court case
OL,21,Fin which a ruling on Drumcree by the
OL,22,FParades Commission was overturned.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
